@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Minimum Wage Law, 5747-1987. THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../registers/source-bundle/minimum-wage-law-5747-1987.he.wiki.txt, Hebrew Wikisource raw
-- MediaWiki, retrieved 2026-10-08, sha256 d74633b3...ef78f5. An unofficial consolidation. A `src:N`
-- comment quotes line N of that file, generated by tools/srcquote.py; nothing in Hebrew here is typed by hand.
--
-- Money is new Israeli shekels (NIS), as a bare NUMBER. Membership test for this module: a witness of
-- ordinary competence could testify to the fact (an age, hours worked, what a payslip line is called).
-- Whether the pay meets the minimum is a rule, and belongs in the section module that says so.

§ `Nouns for the Minimum Wage Law`

§§ `How the employee is paid, and the working week`

-- s 2(a): the monthly, the daily or the hourly minimum wage applies "as the case may be".
-- src:28 | (א) עובד שמלאו לו 18 שנים (להלן – עובד) המועסק במשרה מלאה, כנהוג במקום עבודתו, זכאי לקבל ממעסיקו שכר עבודה שלא יפחת משכר המינימום לחודש, שכר המינימום היומי או שכר המינימום לשעה, הכל לפי הענין.
DECLARE `The basis on which an employee's pay is fixed` IS ONE OF
    `paid by the month`
    `paid by the day`
    `paid by the hour`

-- s 1 "שכר מינימום יומי": a six-day working week or a five-day working week.
-- src:24 | ”שכר מינימום יומי“ – החלק ה־25 של שכר המינימום לגבי עובד המועסק שבוע עבודה בן ששה ימים, והחלק ה־21 2 ⁄ 3 של שכר המינימום לגבי עובד המועסק שבוע עבודה בן חמישה ימים;
DECLARE `The employee's working week` IS ONE OF
    `a six-day working week`
    `a five-day working week`

§§ `An employee`

-- `age in completed years`: s 2(a) "עובד שמלאו לו 18 שנים".
-- `within a class for which section 17 regulations may fix a lower rate`: the employee has a physical,
-- mental or intellectual limitation covered by regulations under s 17; those regulations are not held.
DECLARE `An employee` HAS
    `age in completed years`                                                        IS A NUMBER
    `how pay is fixed`                                                              IS A `The basis on which an employee's pay is fixed`
    `the working week`                                                              IS A `The employee's working week`
    `within a class for which section 17 regulations may fix a lower rate`          IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Hours of work`

-- s 2(b): "משרה חלקית" is a fraction of the position. The Law does not say how to measure it
-- (fork F1), so both facts are recorded: the hours the employee works in the month, and, if known, the
-- hours of a full position as customary at the workplace ("כנהוג במקום עבודתו", s 2(a)).
DECLARE `Hours of work in a month` HAS
    `hours the employee works in the month`                                 IS A NUMBER
    `hours of a full position customary at the workplace in the month`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER

§§ `Switches (forks F1, F2, F3; ruled by Meng 2026-10-08, SHRUG)`

-- F1: how s 2(b) measures "the fraction of his position" by hours.
DECLARE `How the fraction of a position is measured` IS ONE OF
    `decline where the readings differ`
    `by the hours of a full position customary at the workplace`
    `by the 186 hours of a month that section 1 implies`

-- F2: when s 3(d) applies.
DECLARE `When section 3(d) applies` IS ONE OF
    `decline where the readings differ`
    `only when the pay has neither a basic or combined wage nor a cost-of-living supplement`
    `when the pay lacks either of them`

-- F3: a component of pay that s 3(b) neither lists nor excludes.
DECLARE `Whether an unlisted component counts` IS ONE OF
    `decline where the readings differ`
    `it counts`
    `it does not count`

§§ `Pay components`

-- s 3(b)(1)-(3) are the components that count; the proviso names the ones that do not.
-- src:35 | (1) שכר יסוד או שכר משולב;
-- src:36 | (2) תוספת יוקר אם איננה כלולה בשכר המשולב;
-- src:37 | (3) תוספת קבועה המשתלמת לעובד עקב עבודתו,
-- src:40 | ואולם לא יובאו בחשבון תוספת משפחה, תוספת ותק, תוספת בשל עבודה במשמרות, פרמיה מדודה, מוסכמת, קבועה או קבוצתית, משכורת י״ג, מענקים על בסיס שנתי, והחזר הוצאות לרבות הוצאות כלכלה, אש״ל ונסיעות שמשלם המעסיק.
DECLARE `A kind of pay component` IS ONE OF
    `a basic wage or a combined wage`
    `a cost-of-living supplement not included in a combined wage`
    `a fixed supplement paid by reason of the work`
    `a family supplement`
    `a seniority supplement`
    `a supplement for shift work`
    `a measured, agreed, fixed or group premium`
    `a thirteenth salary`
    `an annual grant`
    `a refund of expenses, including board, per diem and travel`
    `a component the text does not name`

DECLARE `A pay component` HAS
    `kind`      IS A `A kind of pay component`
    `amount`    IS A NUMBER

-- s 3(a): the pay is the pay for a regular working day as customary at the workplace; the caller
-- supplies the components of that pay, and, for s 3(d), the regular pay without additions.
DECLARE `Pay for a regular working day` HAS
    `components`                            IS A LIST OF `A pay component`
    `the regular pay without additions`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
